  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tom yum serves 4 and takes about 25 minutes. The soup is built on a simple aromatic broth made with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "lemongrass",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "lemongrass"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "galangal",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "galangal"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "kaffir lime leaves",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "kaffir-lime-leaves"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The prawns are added at the very end so they stay tender and sweet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bruise the lemongrass with the back of a knife before adding it to the pot. This cracks the fibres and releases far more flavour into the broth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
